# Arabella, Abandoned Doll: X is counted only once, as the ability resolves (the 2024-09-20 ruling; CR 608.2h), and the
# drain is damage Arabella deals (CR 120.3), not life loss. With the trigger on the stack, Bot2 Lightning Bolts Elite
# Vanguard (X falls from 2 to 1) and Healing Salve shields itself: the 1 damage Arabella would deal is prevented
# (CR 615.1), and Bot1 still gains 1 life (CR 608.2c).

